      "descriptionEn": "Archived Rhineland-Palatinate source snapshot for upper-secondary physics in the Mainz upper-secondary system with a general orientation anchor, a structural qualification-phase anchor for static electric and magnetic fields, a first reviewed common basic-course / advanced-course corridor on the required building block `Field concept for static electric and magnetic fields`, a first reviewed common follow-on on `Interaction of charged bodies with static fields`, a first narrow reviewed advanced-course follow-on on the `Hall effect` residue of the same RP field sequence, a widened reviewed common induction corridor `Variable electromagnetic fields` including self-induction and switch-on and switch-off processes in the coil, a narrow advanced-course induction residue on the law of induction in differential form, a first reviewed common oscillation corridor `Harmonic Oscillations`, a first reviewed basic-course wave corridor `Harmonic Waves`, a first reviewed basic-course follow-on `Superposition of Waves`, a first narrow reviewed advanced-course follow-on `Harmonic Waves and Their Superposition`, a first narrow reviewed advanced-course required-strip follow-on `Oscillations and Waves`, a first reviewed basic-course quantum corridor `Quantum Objects I`, and a first reviewed basic-course atomic-model corridor `Quantum Mechanical Atomic Model I`.",
